---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = new Date('2026-06-19');
---

<BaseLayout title="Now" description="What Altair Rostam is focused on now.">
  <section class="content-shell py-14 sm:py-20">
    <p class="metadata">Last updated {lastUpdated.toLocaleDateString('en', { month: 'short', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric' })}</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 font-heading text-[clamp(3rem,8vw,6rem)] font-extrabold leading-none">Now</h1>
    <div class="prose-content mt-10">
      <p>
        I am focused on turning AI system work into durable written artifacts: project notes, retrieval lessons, evaluation practices, and the small operational details that usually vanish after a launch.
      </p>
      <p>
        The site itself is part of that work: a static, content-first notebook that can stay current through MDX files instead of a CMS.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
